{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_05",
  "title": "溺火",
  "storyCode": "EA-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a6a8e4fdbc8d239589ec69e7b7d1dd4a269e59c65d51f163f7c0bfee4feed502",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g8_blackforest_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......先前遇上的那个，难道又是捉弄人的幻影？路是错的，我好像又走回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也看不清天色，不知道走了多久......还有多远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我至少没像布莉吉说的那样，被黑雾和噪声挡在黑林之外，我至少进来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是这些爱捉弄人的精怪，会指给你错路的幻影，故意牵来枝条绊倒人的羽兽......倒是和我带莫兰他们回来时差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许是这些树木长得太高，也太茂密。它们遮住了天空，让这里面的生命与外界不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g9_blackforest_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没走错路。这里就是黑林的中心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总感觉......这里的景色也和我来的时候不一样......那些代表秋天的金红色呢，为什么都消失了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么里头变成现在这样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是黑雾？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说，黑林到底还是拒绝了我，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮紧紧握住手中的武器。假如真的如涅梅丝所说，深池离开城市之后就再也没有回来，被黑雾吞噬的确是他们最可能的下场。\n但黑雾并无攻击她的迹象，只是停在原地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它是在......拒绝我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，与其说是拒绝，倒不如说是冷漠......失望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "除了植物婆娑的晃动之外，没有任何能被认成回答的声响。\n拉芙希妮摇摇头，谨慎地经过黑雾身侧，选择了尽头看起来有光亮的一条路，而黑雾仍然对她的通过无动于衷。\n那些乐于把人带上歧途的精怪，此刻也不见踪影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g9_blackforest_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，又是死路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没时间在这里逗留了。抱歉，我得烧出一条路来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你可真是想太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会是......你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在城里的那位......先生。上次我就有问题要问你，但你却——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上次见面确实算得上是不欢而散，不告而别。后面我也跟了你一路，看了你一路，就当是反思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，我得承认你和我想的不太一样，但现在还不是闲聊的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别烧那些树木，只用你的火照亮它们就行了，看看它们到底是什么东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“是什么东西”......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶片锋利，荆棘坚硬，枝条上甚至反射出金属的冷光？这究竟是？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是什么不重要，你的火不可能将其烧穿，这才是重点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在黑雾改了主意之前，跟我来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再晚一会儿跟你搭话，那东西一个心情不好，你就被直接吞了，骨头渣子也不剩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可那边不是死路吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么觉得眼见的东西就一定为实呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听我的，走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g7_blackforest_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......我来纳斯尔纱时走的那条路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚那些小路居然通向这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，虽然冒昧，但您和林中的精怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别傻了，我怎么会和它们扯上关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是这片树林，几百年过去了，除了多了一层黑雾以外，里面居然还是这副样子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，煞风景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再往前几步就算是出了黑林，不知道您能否——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧啧啧，这可真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你身后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草，我们来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "流民们的身影出现在黑林明亮的边缘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城里是不是出了什么事？自从你进城之后，黑雾就像是突然发怒了一样，将城市和外界严密地隔开，黑林已经好几天没人出入了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才有人去黑林外围打猎，听见林子里有响动，有人声，还有火光什么的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前也出过类似的事，守灵人让我们不要靠近黑林，小心惹祸上身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这一次我们都认出来了，那是你的火。我们必须得过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里太危险了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也不该放任你一个人去承担所有的危险。伦蒂尼姆郊外那次，我们在沼泽地等你的时候，大家就已经明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们信任你，你也该信任我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很感激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不算什么。我们先回聚落吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，不知道您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草，怎么了？你在对谁说话？还有人跟着你从黑林里出来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红龙回身看去，那个不请自来的男人，就像是阳光下的露珠一样不见了踪影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g5_remains_outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感谢你们为这些人提供了住所，守灵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅梅丝将他们托付给我们，这就是我们应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，拉芙希妮小姐，守灵人承诺不将您的存在泄露给任何不知情的人。既然您已经确认了这些人的安危，我们可以就此分开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是什么意思？难道你们不欢迎她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫兰，你们也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两条红龙之间总会产生无尽的纷争。如果你们擅自介入两条红龙之间的争斗，那我们也无力再为你们提供庇护。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们怎么这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们一向如此。守灵人既不挑起冲突，也不试图消弭冲突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生者的争端非我们所能干涉，我们只守望逝者的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红龙，如果您真的如莫兰等人所说，是一位悲悯而高尚的领导者，那您就更不该将这些无辜的人卷入您的斗争。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是两条红龙之间的争斗，我是为了纳斯尔纱的居民来向你们求助——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斗争总有理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草不是一个会找借口的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便不是借口，生者的纠纷也与我们无关......这是我们至今仍在为之品尝苦果的教训。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请回吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算我来请你们安葬一位逝者......也不行吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安葬逝者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果的确如此，守灵人的营地会向您敞开，但也仅限葬礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烦请告诉我逝者的姓名，事迹，还有......请把他的亡骸交给我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他叫......库林，城里的铁匠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "库林？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的死因是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他被紫色的死火夺取了生命与意志，即便是我的火焰......也无法再拯救他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那为什么从所谓独立到现在，没有一个纳斯尔纱人来找我们，让我们帮城内的逝者举行一场符合传统的葬礼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战争结束后，第一个得到哀悼的纳斯尔纱人......甚至没有死在那场战争中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g10_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像这样......把干草扎成环？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错，然后把这些花卉装饰在上面，编成花环就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记得我们在路上也有这么一次，农民们把花环戴在你头上，祈求来年风调雨顺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真怀念啊，感觉又回到那个时候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这里住得不开心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我自己倒是很自在，但其他人可能多少会觉得有些拘束吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为守灵人的生活就像在和自己过不去嘛。莫兰，你那个词是怎么说的来着，“苦修”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不喝酒，不开宴会，不吃过分烹饪的东西，甚至不会大声说笑。每天从天不亮起床开始，直到半夜睡下，无论做什么都有仪式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然他们不用这一套来要求我们，但我们毕竟也得帮人家干干农活什么的，总是要打交道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这几天住下来，我都觉得自己快要不会笑了，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有莫兰每天都会去找守灵人说话，每天都能学一点东西回来。今天是绳结的编法，明天是如何估算树木寿命之类的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这倒是没错，不过和那些故事中的守灵人相比......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红龙阁下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "守灵人女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没想到您会在这里与他们一同劳作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草一直都是这样啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要我们回避吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我只是为了仪式需要，来确认死者的生平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请告诉我，红龙，这段时间里，库林身上究竟发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会一五一十地把我见到的一切告诉你，守灵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望这些事能对你有所触动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
